<title>MEXICO: Mexico's president to visit Guatemala.</title>
<headline>Mexico's president to visit Guatemala.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's President Ernesto Zedillo will conduct a working visit to Guatemala on September 9.</p>
<p>Zedillo will meet with Guatemala's President Alvaro Arzu Irigoyen to discuss bilateral issues, the Mexican Foreign Affairs Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newroom (525) 728 9559</p>
